{"strongs": "H5643", "word": "סֵ֫תֶר", "translit": "se.ter", "root": "סתר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "covering, hiding-place, secrecy", "definition": "סֵ֫תֶר noun [masculine] covering, hiding-place, secrecy ; — absolute ׳ ס Judg 3:19 +, ס֑תֶר 2Sam 12:12 ; Prov 25:23 , סֶ֑תֶר Ps 139:15 construct סֵ֫תֶר 1Sam 25:20 +; suffix סִתְרוֺ Ps 18:12 (insert also || 2Sam 22:12 ᵐ5 ᵑ6 Th Bu HPS ), סִתְרִי Ps 119:114 plural סְתָרִים Prov 9:17 — 1. covering, cover , הָהָר ׳ בְּס 1Sam 25:20 under cover of the mountain , concealed by it; of clouds as covering for ׳ י (shutting out his view) Job 22:14 , of darkness (i.e. dark clouds) as ׳ י 's hiding-place (in theoph.) Ps 18:12 (= 2Sam 22:12 see above), so רַ֑עַם ׳ ס 2Sam 81:8 hiding-place of thunder ; of adulterer פָּנִים ׳ ס יָשִׂים Job 24:15 i.e. disguiseth himself. 2. a. hidng-place , 1Sam 19:2 ; Isa 28:17 הַמַּדְרֵגָה ׳ ס Song 2:14 (in figurative; || חַגְוֵי הַסֶּלַע ), of hippopotamus Job 40:21 figurative of Israel as shelter to Moab with מִפְּנֵי Isa 16:6 , of ideal Israelite, as זֶרֶם ׳ ס Isa 32:2 , especially of ׳ י as shelter: אָהֳלוֺ ׳ ס Ps 27:5 , פָּנֶיךָ ׳ ס Ps 31:21 , כְּנָפֶיךָ ׳ ס Ps 61:5 , עֶלְיוֺן ׳ ס Ps 91:1 , לִי ׳ אַתָּה ס Ps 32:7 compare Ps 119:114 . \\ \\ b. secret place , of womb Ps 139:15 (|| תַּחְתִּיּוֺת אָ֑רֶץ ). 3. secrecy: ׳ דְּבַרסֿ Judg 3:19 a matter of secrecy , secret matter; plural abstract intensive לֶחֶם סְתָרִים Prov 9:17 bread of utter secrecy (i.e. gained stealthily, || מַיִם גְּנוּבִים ); לְשֹׁן סָ֑תֶר Prov 25:23 tongue of secrecy , i.e. slanderous; elsewhere ׳ בַּסּ in secrecy, secretly Deut 13:7 ; Deut 27:15 ; Deut 27:24 ; Deut 28:57 ; Deut 2:12 ; Deut 38:16 ; Deut 40:15 ; Deut 48:16 ; Deut 31:27 ; Ps 101:5 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5724')\">BDB5724</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5643')\">H5643</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5723')\">BDB5723</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5725'