egin=\"25\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,20)\">1Sam 25:20</ref> <highlight>under cover of the mountain</highlight>, concealed by it; of clouds as covering for <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> (shutting out his view) <ref ref=\"Job 22:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,14)\">Job 22:14</ref>, of darkness (i.e. dark clouds) as <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s <highlight>hiding-place</highlight> (in theoph.) <ref ref=\"Ps 18:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,12)\">Ps 18:12</ref> (= <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,12)\">2Sam 22:12</ref> see above), so <bdbheb>רַ֑עַם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ס</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Sam 81:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"81\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"81\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,81,8)\">2Sam 81:8</ref> <highlight>hiding-place of thunder</highlight>; of adulterer <bdbheb>פָּנִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ס</bdbheb> <bdbheb>יָשִׂים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 24:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,15)\">Job 24:15</ref> i.e. disguiseth himself. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. a.</b> <highlight>hidng-place</highlight>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,2)\">1Sam 19:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 28:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,17)\">Isa 28:17</ref> <bdbheb>הַמַּדְרֵגָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ס</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 2:14\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(22,2,14)\">Song 2:14</ref> (in figurative; || <bdbheb>חַגְוֵי הַסֶּלַע</bdbheb>), of hippopotamus <ref ref=\"Job 40:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,21)\">Job 40:21</ref> figurative of Israel a